schway-screen 1
screen startup-model
title Startup model unavailable
description A reopened conversation whose model is gone offers model choice.
variant dark-80
size 80x30
cursor 7 27 visible
== text
 ⚡ schway  /project

  ▌ You
  ▌ Explain the config loader


